  "description": "The Step-thru GoPlus is the perfect companion for all your travels and adventures, offering convenience, comfort, and versatility in one sleek e-bike. Featuring a step-thru frame crafted from durable 6061 aluminum alloy, this e-bike is designed for easy mounting and dismounting, making it a great choice for riders of all ages and abilities.\nThe GoPlus e-bike comes with multiple riding modes to suit your needs: pedal assist for a smooth, powered ride, throttle mode for effortless cruising, manual pedal mode for a more traditional cycling experience, and walk mode for when you need a little help walking the bike. This versatility ensures that you can adapt to any terrain or situation.\nAdditionally, the Step-thru GoPlus is equipped with practical features such as a pannier bag for convenient storage, and a phone holder for easy access to your device while on the go. It arrives fully assembled, so you can start enjoying your ride right away without any hassle.\nWith its combination of comfort, practicality, and flexibility, the Step-thru GoPlus is an excellent choice for those looking to explore, commute, or simply enjoy the freedom of cycling.\n\n20mph Top Speed\n\nUp to 50 miles Range\n\n750 W Hub Motor\n\n48V 10Ah",
